  "reading": {
   "title": "Hafsa's busy weekend",
   "text": "Last weekend was busy but nice for Hafsa. On Saturday morning she washed the laundry and cleaned the apartment. In the afternoon she baked a cake because her neighbor Linda invited her to a small picnic in the park.\n\nThe weather was perfect. Linda walked to the park with her dog, and Hafsa carried the cake. They talked, laughed and enjoyed the sun. Emre joined them and played soccer with two boys. Many families also enjoyed the park that day, and the children played near the trees. Nobody stayed inside!\n\nOn Sunday, Hafsa relaxed at home. It was a quiet day, and she liked it. She watched a Turkish movie and called an old classmate in Isparta. At night she finished her homework for English class. \"It was a lovely weekend,\" she thought.",
   "glossary": [
    {
     "en": "joined",
     "tr": "katıldı"
    },
    {
     "en": "nobody",
     "tr": "hiç kimse"
    },
    {
     "en": "stayed inside",
     "tr": "içeride kaldı"
    },
    {
     "en": "classmate",
     "tr": "sınıf arkadaşı"
    }
   ],
